{"sha": "f8722289824b34e69d2e148008f93da106fd8b1dc414c4b050497292317b2755", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:arith} 章 --- 整数算术}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:arith:1}", "$1001 = 1 \\times 777 + 224$; $777 = 3 \\times 224 + 105$; $224 = 2", "\\times 105 + 14$；$105 = 7 \\times 14 + 7$；$14 = 2 \\times 7 + 0$。由此", "$\\gcd(1001, 777) = 7$。回代得：", "\\[", "7 = 105 - 7 \\times 14", "= 105 - 7(224 - 2\\times 105) = 15 \\times 105 - 7 \\times 224", "\\]", "\\[", "= 15(777 - 3\\times 224) - 7\\times 224 = 15 \\times 777 - 52 \\times 224", "= 15 \\times 777 - 52(1001 - 777) = 67 \\times 777 - 52 \\times 1001 .", "\\]", "检验：$67 \\times 777 = 52\\,059$ 与 $52 \\times 1001 = 52\\,052$；", "差为 $7$。贝祖对：$(u, v) = (-52, 67)$，使 $1001u + 777v =", "7$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:arith:2}", "由 $10 \\equiv 1 \\pmod 9$，得 $10^k \\equiv 1$，故 $\\sum_k d_k 10^k", "\\equiv \\sum_k d_k \\pmod 9$。由 $10 \\equiv -1 \\pmod{11}$，得 $10^k", "\\equiv (-1)^k$，故该整数与交错和", "$\\sum_k (-1)^k d_k$ 模 $11$ 同余（自\\emph{个位}数字起", "符号为 $+$）。", "", "$123\\,456\\,789$：数字和 $45 \\equiv 0 \\pmod 9$。交错和", "自个位起：$9 - 8 + 7 - 6 + 5 - 4 + 3 - 2 + 1 = 5$，故该数", "$\\equiv 5 \\pmod{11}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:arith:3}", "欧几里得算法：$237 = 2 \\times 91 + 55$；$91 = 1 \\times 55 + 36$；$55 = 1", "\\times 36 + 19$；$36 = 1 \\times 19 + 17$；$19 = 1 \\times 17 + 2$；$17", "= 8 \\times 2 + 1$。回代得：", "\\[", "1 = 17 - 8\\times 2 = 17 - 8(19 - 17) = 9\\times 17 - 8\\times 19", "= 9(36 - 19) - 8\\times 19 = 9\\times 36 - 17\\times 19", "\\]", "\\[", "= 9\\times 36 - 17(55 - 36) = 26\\times 36 - 17\\times 55", "= 26(91 - 55) - 17\\times 55 = 26\\times 91 - 43\\times 55", "\\]", "\\[", "= 26\\times 91 - 43(237 - 2\\times 91) = 112 \\times 91 - 43 \\times 237.", "\\]", "故 $91 \\times 112 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{237}$，解为 $x \\equiv", "112 \\pmod{237}$。（检验：$91 \\times 112 = 10\\,192 = 43 \\times 237 +", "1$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:arith:4}", "$\\gcd(17, 39) = 1$：欧几里得算法给出 $39 = 2\\times 17 + 5$，$17 = 3\\times", "5 + 2$，$5 = 2\\times 2 + 1$，回代得", "\\[", "1 = 5 - 2\\times 2 = 5 - 2(17 - 3\\times 5) = 7\\times 5 - 2\\times 17", "= 7(39 - 2\\times 17) - 2\\times 17 = 7\\times 39 - 16\\times 17 .", "\\]", "特解为 $(x_0, y_0) = (-16, 7)$。齐次方程", "$17x + 39y = 0$ 的通解：$x = 39k$，$y = -17k$（由于", "$17 \\mid 39y$ 且 $\\gcd(17,39) = 1$ 推出 $17 \\mid y$ ---", "高斯引理）。于是", "\\[", "(x, y) = (-16 + 39k,\\; 7 - 17k), \\qquad k \\in \\Z .", "\\]", "右端为 $5$ 时，将特解乘以 $5$：", "$(x, y) = (-80 + 39k,\\; 35 - 17k)$，$k \\in \\Z$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:arith:5}", "对每个质数 $p$，记 $\\alpha = v_p(a)$，$\\beta = v_p(b)$，则", "\\[", "v_p\\bigl(\\gcd(a,b)\\bigr) + v_p\\bigl(\\operatorname{lcm}(a,b)\\bigr)", "= \\min(\\alpha, \\beta) + \\max(\\alpha, \\beta)", "= \\alpha + \\beta = v_p(ab) .", "\\]", "两个正整数若在每个质数处赋值相同，则必相等", "（见\\cref{prop:b1:arith:valuation}），故 $\\gcd(a,b)\\operatorname{lcm}(a,b)", "= ab$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:arith:6}", "赋值计算：$\\gcd(a, b) = 2^{\\min(10,6)} 3^{\\min(4,7)} 5^{\\min(2,0)}", "7^{\\min(0,1)} = 2^6\\, 3^4 = 5184$;", "$\\operatorname{lcm}(a,b) = 2^{10}\\, 3^7\\, 5^2\\, 7$.", "", "因数个数：$n = \\prod p_i^{\\alpha_i}$ 的正因数恰为", "形如 $\\prod p_i^{\\beta_i}$ 的数，其中 $0 \\leq \\beta_i \\leq", "\\alpha_i$（见\\cref{prop:b1:arith:valuation}）；这些取法", "相互独立，故共有 $\\prod_i (\\alpha_i + 1)$ 个因数。对 $a$：", "$(10+1)(4+1)(2+1) = 165$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:arith:7}", "设 $\\sqrt p = \\frac rq$，其中 $r, q \\in \\N^*$，即 $p q^2 =", "r^2$。两边取 $v_p$：$v_p(pq^2) = 1 + 2v_p(q)$ 为奇数，而 $v_p(r^2)", "= 2 v_p(r)$ 为偶数。一个整数不可能同时具有奇、偶两种", "$p$ 赋值：矛盾。故 $\\sqrt p \\notin \\Q$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:arith:8}", "\\emph{一般事实。}由 $\\gcd(m,n) = 1$，贝祖等式给出 $mu + nv = 1$。", "取 $x_0 = b\\,mu + a\\,nv$。则 $x_0 \\equiv a\\,nv \\equiv a(1 - mu)", "\\equiv a \\pmod m$，同理 $x_0 \\equiv b \\pmod n$，存在性得证。若", "$x$ 与 $x'$ 为两个解，则 $m$ 与 $n$ 都整除 $x - x'$，", "故 $mn \\mid x - x'$（见\\cref{thm:b1:arith:gauss}~(2)），于是在模", "$mn$ 下唯一。", "", "\\emph{数值计算：}$m = 7$，$n = 11$：$7 \\times (-3) + 11 \\times 2 =", "1$。故 $x_0 = 5 \\times 7 \\times (-3) + 2 \\times 11 \\times 2 = -105 +", "44 = -61 \\equiv 16 \\pmod{77}$。检验：$16 = 2\\times 7 + 2 \\equiv 2", "\\pmod 7$；$16 = 11 + 5 \\equiv 5 \\pmod{11}$。所求解为 $x \\equiv 16", "\\pmod{77}$。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}